    "coverage": "The prefix covers the complete 54-cell battery \u00d7 service-count \u00d7 consumption \u00d7 minimum-depot-gap factorial, with 34 cells represented twice and 20 three times. Duty start stride is 64/64 marginally, but every primary cell uses only one stride, so only 54 of the possible 108 five-factor cells appear. Thus 128 IDs are replicated samples of one finite synthetic design; they do not independently identify the stride effect.",
    "future_gaps": [
      "Factorial separation: cross the 25/30-minute start stride within each existing battery \u00d7 service-count \u00d7 consumption \u00d7 depot-gap cell, so stride effects are not aliased with the primary design.",
      "External physical breadth: vary depot/charger topology, connector count and power limits, terminal availability, and route/timetable geometry; validate usable-capacity/SOC assumptions instead of treating the nameplate-scaled spans as field-calibrated profiles."
